  auto-refresh on the stale transition). Save / delete mutations surface a transient toast (web useToast).
Data sources bound via the shared P1/S8 Source seam (no view HTTP): useQuietHours, useSaveQuietHours,
  useDeleteQuietHours, useToast, useTranslation, useNotifications. The web `seedDraft` / `onSeedConsumed`
