  prompt, omitted with a documented note in the view header.
Native mapping: web <Input type="time"> → TSDatePickerBridge .hourAndMinute (bridged to the HH:MM API
  strings; all validation kept pure for parity + tests); web <Select> tz → TSSelect over IANA known
  identifiers; web purple/amber Tailwind chips → token-driven selectable chips (accent / warning tones);
  web nextWindowChangeLabel English template → typed QuietHoursNextChange localised at the view boundary
  (no English literal in code). No Recharts / Leaflet in this surface (charts/maps n/a).

